      "containerId": "r-client",
      "originalText": "MiX.ConfigInternal.Api.Client  (HTTP client — replaces old DeviceConfigClient)\nGetAssetsWithOutdatedDaylightSavingsCommands(authToken, DaylightSavingsCommand)  →  POST /outdated-daylight-savings\nSendCommandsToAssetsWithOutdatedDaylightSavingsCommands(authToken, List<AssetDSTCommand>)  →  POST /send-command-to-outdated-daylight-savings\nSendDaylightSavingsCommandToMobileUnits(authToken, DaylightSavingsCommand)  →  POST /daylight-savings",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
