    {
      "id": "t-cornell",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 1860,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "Cornell's shortcut — call Config.Api directly:\nStep 1:  POST /outdated-daylight-savings\n         body: { GroupIds: \"orgId\", MobileUnitIds: \"assetId\", TypeIds: \"\" }\nStep 2:  POST /send-command-to-outdated-daylight-savings\n         body: [{ GroupId, MobileUnitId, IsRemoteCommandConnected, Param1, Param2, Param3 }]\n\nOR simplest:  POST /daylight-savings  (sends all outdated for org automatically)\nSwagger INT:  http://ecs-api.config.int.priv/swagger/index.html",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e2e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
