      "containerId": "r-cornell",
      "originalText": "Cornell's shortcut — call Config.Api directly:\nStep 1:  POST /outdated-daylight-savings\n         body: { GroupIds: \"orgId\", MobileUnitIds: \"assetId\", TypeIds: \"\" }\nStep 2:  POST /send-command-to-outdated-daylight-savings\n         body: [{ GroupId, MobileUnitId, IsRemoteCommandConnected, Param1, Param2, Param3 }]\n\nOR simplest:  POST /daylight-savings  (sends all outdated for org automatically)\nSwagger INT:  http://ecs-api.config.int.priv/swagger/index.html",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
